1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:22,000
Six constructed study records enter the actual analytics core.
Three are accepted; three are rejected. No learner data is used.

2
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:44,000
The measured zero becomes a missing score.
Accepted sessions fall to two. Missing is not measured zero.

3
00:00:44,000 --> 00:01:06,000
Restoring the measured zero restores the accepted record.
The unfinished retry remains incomplete.

4
00:01:06,000 --> 00:01:28,000
Withdrawing example A removes both of its session records.
The aggregate is recomputed from the retained examples.

5
00:01:28,000 --> 00:01:50,000
The downloaded aggregate omits participant and session rows.
These software checks establish no learning or causal benefit.
